      "writtenOn": "2019-07-26T03:48:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although .bss.vector_table was in bss section, its initialized data would get copied into SRAM in init.S. When moving the .bss.vector_table out of bss section, it will still get initialized.",
